	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By shifting your position into a devastating lock, you render your opponent impotent. As an action, you implement a submission maneuver that disables both you and your opponent. So long as you maintain the grapple, neither you nor your target may take actions, bonus actions, or reactions except to escape the grapple. On any failed attempt to escape the grapple your target takes your unarmed strike damage.</p>",
